/ActualText (Detail-oriented UI/UX Designer with 5+ years of experience designing user-centered digital products across healthcare, e-commerce, and SaaS platforms. Skilled in wireframing, prototyping, usability testing, and design systems using Figma, Adobe XD, and InVision. Track record of simplifying complex multi-role workflows, improving accessibility of critical data, and reducing friction through research-driven redesigns. Experienced presenting design solutions directly to stakeholders and collaborating closely with developers and product managers in Agile teams.)
